  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A geyser heats water flowing at a rate of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> per minute from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>70</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. If geyser operates on a gas burner, the rate of combustion of fuel will be _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p>[Heat of combustion <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>Jg</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, Specific heat of water <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Jg</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts/><none/><mo>&#8728;</mo></mmultiscripts><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "42",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given here, mass flow rate of water,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The geyser heats the water, raising the temperature from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>.</p><p>Total heat utilised in raising the temperature,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo></math> heat of combination<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now, rate of consumption of fuel is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
